  "properties": {
    "long_instructions": "# Practice\r\n\r\nLet's take some time evaulating AI tools from a data privacy perspective.\r\n\r\n1. Think about a situation where you might use AI (e.g., student writing support, lesson planning, or classroom activities).\r\n2. Choose an AI tool you might use.\r\n3. Use the checklist to evaulate the tool.\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"width:80%; max-width:900px; margin:0 auto; font-family:ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial; color:#292F36;\">\r\n\r\n<div style=\"font-size:24px; font-weight:800; margin-bottom:12px; text-align:center;\">\r\nEvaluating an AI Tool for Classroom Use\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #D9DDE3; border-radius:16px; overflow:hidden; background:#FFFFFF; box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(41,47,54,0.06);\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ROW -->\r\n<div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:80px 1fr; border-bottom:1px solid #E8ECF0;\">\r\n<div style=\"background:#8C52BA; color:#FFFFFF; font-weight:800; font-size:24px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;\">\r\n1\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"padding:16px;\">\r\n<div style=\"font-weight:800; font-size:18px; margin-bottom:6px;\">Check for an Educational Focus</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size:15px; line-height:1.5;\">\r\n<div>☐ Confirm the tool is designed for educational use</div>\r\n<div>☐ Identify features such as teacher controls, student safeguards, or classroom alignment</div>\r\n<div style=\"margin-top:6px;\">➡️ If the tool is not education-specific, proceed with caution.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<!-- ROW -->\r\n<div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:80px 1fr; border-bottom:1px solid #E8ECF0;\">\r\n<div style=\"background:#8C52BA; color:#FFFFFF; font-weight:800; font-size:24px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;\">\r\n2\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"padding:16px;\">\r\n<div style=\"font-weight:800; font-size:18px; margin-bottom:6px;\">Review Documentation and Support Materials</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size:15px; line-height:1.5;\">\r\n<div>☐ Read help articles, guides, or support pages</div>\r\n<div>☐ Identify how the tool is intended to be used</div>\r\n<div>☐ Locate information about safety features</div>\r\n<div>☐ Review how the tool handles data</div>\r\n<div style=\"margin-top:6px;\">➡️ Clear, transparent documentation is a positive sign.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<!-- ROW -->\r\n<div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:80px 1fr; border-bottom:1px solid #E8ECF0;\">\r\n<div style=\"background:#8C52BA; color:#FFFFFF; font-weight:800; font-size:24px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;\">\r\n3\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"padding:16px;\">\r\n<div style=\"font-weight:800; font-size:18px; margin-bottom:6px;\">Examine the Privacy Policy</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size:15px; line-height:1.5;\">\r\n<div>☐ Locate and review the privacy policy</div>\r\n<div>☐ Confirm references to educational use</div>\r\n<div>☐ Check for compliance with laws (e.g., FERPA, COPPA)</div>\r\n<div>☐ Identify how user data is collected, stored, and used</div>\r\n<div style=\"margin-top:6px;\">➡️ If this information is unclear or missing, reconsider using the tool.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<!-- ROW -->\r\n<div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:80px 1fr; border-bottom:1px solid #E8ECF0;\">\r\n<div style=\"background:#8C52BA; color:#FFFFFF; font-weight:800; font-size:24px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;\">\r\n4\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"padding:16px;\">\r\n<div style=\"font-weight:800; font-size:18px; margin-bottom:6px;\">Adjust Privacy Settings</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size:15px; line-height:1.5;\">\r\n<div>☐ Review all available privacy and security settings</div>\r\n<div>☐ Limit data sharing where possible</div>\r\n<div>☐ Turn off optional or unnecessary features</div>\r\n<div>☐ Restrict access to appropriate users</div>\r\n<div style=\"margin-top:6px;\">➡️ Always configure settings to maximize student data protection.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<!-- ROW -->\r\n<div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:80px 1fr;\">\r\n<div style=\"background:#8C52BA; color:#FFFFFF; font-weight:800; font-size:24px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;\">\r\n5\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"padding:16px;\">\r\n<div style=\"font-weight:800; font-size:18px; margin-bottom:6px;\">Follow School and District Guidance</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size:15px; line-height:1.5;\">\r\n<div>☐ Verify whether the tool is approved by your school or district</div>\r\n<div>☐ Follow local policies and guidelines for AI use</div>\r\n<div>☐ Consult administration if unsure about appropriate use</div>\r\n<div style=\"margin-top:6px;\">➡️ When in doubt, check before using the tool.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n> In the reflection box below, summarize your findings. What steps would you take to ensure safe and appropriate use of this tool?\r\n\r\n<br>",
